# The Airflow plug's client side, for episode images built with
# `--warehouse-clients airflow` (Dockerfile ALKERA_WAREHOUSE_CLIENTS).
# airflowctl - Airflow 3's REST-only CLI (apache-airflow-ctl) - talks to the
# fake's /api/v2 like any other client; the `airflow` CLI is deliberately NOT
# here: it needs a metadata database, and this box has none.
